HEADS AA
START ** CHECK_COL ** SR

CHECK_COL #= CHECK_COL ** DD
CHECK_COL #_ CHECK_COL ** DD
CHECK_COL #| FOUND     ** SS
CHECK_COL _* CHECK_NXT ** UU

// Move back to the top
CHECK_NXT #* CHECK_NXT ** UU
CHECK_NXT _* CHECK_RT  ** DD
CHECK_RT  ** CHECK_COL ** SR

// FOUND
//   - Move back to the top
//   - While moving back down, place a | in every row then clear to the right
//   - Stop
FOUND          ** FOUND_MOVE_TOP ** SS
FOUND_MOVE_TOP #* FOUND_MOVE_TOP ** UU
FOUND_MOVE_TOP _* FOUND_DO_WORK  ** DD

FOUND_DO_WORK  #* FOUND_CLEAR_RT *| SR
FOUND_DO_WORK  _* STOP           ** SS
FOUND_CLEAR_RT #! FOUND_CLEAR_RT *_ SR
FOUND_CLEAR_RT #_ FOUND_GO_BACK  ** SL
FOUND_GO_BACK  #_ FOUND_GO_BACK  ** SL
FOUND_GO_BACK  #! FOUND_DO_WORK  ** DD
